 Everett Public Schools (
@EverettSchools
) in Washington issues a public apology and will pay $275K in fees after they reportedly discriminated against Christian students.

The school reportedly forced them to seal their Bibles in envelopes so they wouldn't be "exposed" to other students, per NYP,

